| `scripts/tool_reports.py` | The shared reader of an agent tool report: `read_report` accepts a JSON object or list of objects and raises `ToolReportUnreadable`, a RuntimeError with the exit helper's three parts, for blank, non-JSON, too deeply nested or wrong-shaped output; names the repo-relative tool, status, root, stderr and remedy. | imported by `agents/doc_reviewer`, `agents/index_enforcer`, `agents/practice_refactor`, `agents/wiki_navigator` and `scripts/refactor_practice.py` | — | Does not select verdicts from status or validate individual fields. Both import names share one module and error class. Stdlib-only and safe on the oldest hook interpreter; never ends the process. Configuration is read by `scripts/config_loader.py`. | [CONVENTIONS.md](../../CONVENTIONS.md) | always |
